        {
          "text": "[ ] **Used?**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 110,
          "source": "topic-set-learning-chat-gpts-style-of-prompting-🆔20251019221940.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**In-Context Learning (ICL) Sensitivity:** How many \"few-shot\" examples does ChatGPT need to learn a new format compared to Gemini? You will find their learning rates from examples differ.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 116,
          "source": "topic-set-learning-chat-gpts-style-of-prompting-🆔20251019221940.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Constraint Following and \"Negative Prompts\":** Explore the best way to tell ChatGPT what *not* to do. It often responds better to positive framing (\"You must write in a formal tone\") than negative framing (\"Do not use a casual tone\").",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 118,
          "source": "topic-set-learning-chat-gpts-style-of-prompting-🆔20251019221940.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The \"GPTs\" Ecosystem:** Investigate how building a \"Custom GPT\" is essentially an advanced form of prompt engineering, where you are pre-loading a powerful system prompt, knowledge files, and API actions (tools) for others to use.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 119,
          "source": "topic-set-learning-chat-gpts-style-of-prompting-🆔20251019221940.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**API-Specific Features:** Look into parameters like `temperature`, `top_p`, and `frequency_penalty`. These are the \"dials\" you can't access in the chat interface but are essential for tuning API-based prompts.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 120,
          "source": "topic-set-learning-chat-gpts-style-of-prompting-🆔20251019221940.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Prompt Caching:** A technical API-level feature where providers, including OpenAI and Google, cache parts of your prompt to reduce latency and cost, which can have its own implications.",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 121,
          "source": "topic-set-learning-chat-gpts-style-of-prompting-🆔20251019221940.md"
        }
      ]
    },
